---
Resolve sample paths relative to executable. (Partially done)

Sample loading should resolve paths relative to the executable location,
not the current working directory, so the app works when launched from
any directory.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Helper function to get executable directory (Linux, macOS, Windows)
- [ ] Sample paths resolved relative to exe dir, then fallback to absolute
- [ ] Project file sample paths stored as relative when possible
- [ ] Works on all three platforms

## Test Plan
- [ ] Launch from different working directory, verify samples load
- [ ] Save project with samples, move exe, verify relative paths resolve
- [ ] Test on Linux and Windows at minimum
